                    <p>
                        AI in Healthcare introduces the use of
                        artificial intelligence in modern medicine,
                        including AI-powered diagnostics, virtual
                        health assistants and predictive analytics.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        This website was created as partial fulfilment
                        of the assessment requirements for Web Design
                        and Programming at the University of Canberra.
                    </p>

                    <p>
                        The website is built using ASP.NET Core MVC,
                        C#, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript and Bootstrap 5,
                        with responsive layouts using Flexbox and Grid.
                    </p>
